w: Lit-tle babe sleep up-on my knee!_
N:2: For the cradle is wrought of gold, And a Child therein, Of the whole world the Lord and Master, sleeps.
N:3: In the hand-hold of Kaushalya Is the cradle-cord, And the cord is the thread of Bodhana (knowledge).
N:4: And the Devis (goddesses) are strewing flowers From the highest heaven, And with each flower a blessing.
